WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.630
Rest a bat across one finger, and slide
your finger along it until it balances.

2
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:11.140
A uniform rod is easy: by symmetry,
it balances exactly at its middle.

3
00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:13.590
But a bat is thicker at one end.

4
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.710
Its mass is not spread
evenly along its length.

5
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.260
How do you find the exact
point where it balances?

6
00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:24.350
In this mission, you'll slice a
rod into tiny elements of mass,

7
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.730
and turn a sum into an integral.

8
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.770
Then you'll find total
mass when density varies,

9
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.300
and balance a triangle by
slicing it into strips.

10
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:38.350
Your mission: find the exact balance
point of a bat that is thicker at one end.
